<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>页面不存在 (404) - 盈云购系统</title>
    <style is:global>
      :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eaf4ff 0%, #fff 60%); color: #151a24; }
      .not-found { text-align: center; padding: 48px 24px; }
      .code { font-size: 88px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.04em; color: #0b74ff; }
      h1 { margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: 24px; }
      p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #6b7a90; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
      a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 46px; padding: 0 26px; margin-top: 32px; border-radius: 999px; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #19c8ff, #0877ff); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800; }
      a:hover { filter: brightness(1.05); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="not-found">
      <div class="code">404</div>
      <h1>页面不存在</h1>
      <p>你访问的页面可能已被移动或删除。<br />返回首页查看盈云购系统源码展示。</p>
      <a href="/">返回首页</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
